# Google Places (New) — powers delivery address search and the delivery-radius
# check. Server-side only, deliberately not NEXT_PUBLIC_: the key is never
# served to the browser, it's proxied through /api/places.
#
# Enable "Places API (New)" on the project, then restrict the key by API to
# that alone. An IP restriction is the right second lock here rather than an
# HTTP-referrer one, since the calls come from the server.
#
# Without this set, /api/places answers 503 and delivery says so plainly
# instead of silently finding no addresses. Pickup and Outpost are unaffected.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
